%% title: DE — Saga execution, character mint & nickname pre-emption (as of 2024-04)
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant G as Game server
    box rgb(219,234,254) My contributions ★
    participant BP as business-provider<br/>(input validation ★)
    participant S as saga-provider<br/>(Saga runner · validators ★)
    participant A as Transaction analyzer<br/>(partial ★)
    end
    participant R as Redis
    participant E as event-service<br/>(state store)
    participant BC as Blockchain
    G->>BP: Mint character
    BP->>BP: Validate input
    BP->>S: Saga Execute
    S->>R: Pre-empt nickname · lock character ★<br/>(lock instead of existence check)
    S->>E: Prepare: create new nickname · remove old one
    S->>BC: Mint transaction
    BC-->>A: Chain result
    A->>S: Mint success/failure + nickname ★
    alt success
        S->>E: Commit nickname change
        S->>R: Release old nickname pre-emption ★
    else failure
        S->>E: Roll back the prepared change
        S->>R: Release new nickname pre-emption ★
    end
    S->>R: Release character lock ★
